## English Summary

This plugin is **free for individual, non-commercial use**. Institutional or commercial use — including deployment to two or more mentors, organization-wide assessment, paid services, white-label/OEM, or training — requires a **written license** from the project team.

The plugin does **not** provide model APIs; users supply their own API keys and are responsible for data compliance and costs. AI outputs are drafts requiring human review. Provided “as is”, without warranty. “白日梦 / 白日梦行动 / 素养评估” are trademarks of the project team.

For licensing: contact the PBL-EDU project team.
